    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of available capacity, our company's have a dedicated team consisting of a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, with additional resources for change management and training. our company's can handle up to four concurrent public health engagements, and our company's availability has been confirmed. our company's hybrid delivery model, combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, is well-suited to support the development of an intelligent assistance tool that meets the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires the intelligent assistance tool to be capable of supporting hospital staff in clinical administrative activities, provide response times compatible with daily clinical use, achieve a response time below 2 seconds for common queries, integrate with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), support health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR), and rely on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each of these requirements, state whether our current technical stack is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED, or NOT COVERED, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirement for supporting hospital staff in clinical administrative activities is FULLY COVERED as our platform Atelier can be used to provide intelligent assistance for various tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The requirement for response times compatible with daily clinical use and achieving a response time below 2 seconds for common queries is FULLY COVERED, given that our performance metrics indicate a median latency of 1.3 seconds and common single-document queries are below 2 seconds at p95." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI) is FULLY COVERED through standard connectors and custom adapters as needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR is FULLY COVERED, specifically with our FHIR_HL7 connector in production for main resources and extended resource coverage on the roadmap, aligned with Ségur / Mon espace santé–DMP framework and delivered in partnership with Ligeo Santé." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The requirement for relying on low-carbon infrastructure is FULLY COVERED by hosting on OuraneCloud's Sovereign HDS tier, which is renewable-powered. the proposed architecture would involve deploying our platform Atelier on the Sovereign HDS tier of OuraneCloud's, utilizing the model options that best fit the client's needs, such as the sovereign European open-weight model for the sovereign European open-weight model for its fully auditable and grounded response characteristics fully auditable and grounded response characteristics." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup ensures compliance with all specified requirements while providing a scalable and performant solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands strict compliance with GDPR, data sovereignty, encryption, and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must not introduce a rupture in clinical or administrative workflows and must guarantee the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are our company's security controls, certifications (e.g., Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification), and experience with EU regulatory frameworks that demonstrate our company's ability to meet these requirements? our company's, has implemented various security controls to ensure compliance with GDPR and other regulatory requirements. various security controls include secure software development life cycle practices such as code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing conducted by an external CREST-equivalent provider. our company's also have defined remediation SLAs for vulnerability management, incident response procedures, and segregation of duties between development and production operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of certifications, our company's hold ISO 27001 certification since 2023, with a scope that covers development, delivery, and operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's are certified to the ISO 27701 standard, which is an extension for privacy information management. our company's also possess HDS certification through our company's hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud, ensuring data sovereignty and compliance with health-data hosting regulations. our company's experience with EU regulatory frameworks includes delivering solutions that comply with GDPR, particularly for public-sector and health clients handling special-category health data. our company's are familiar with various regulatory frameworks and guidance, including CNIL guidance, HDS reference framework, and HAS guidance on AI in healthcare. our company's control mapping links platform features to applicable obligations, and our company's maintain audit evidence to demonstrate compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's data protection measures include encryption in transit using TLS 1.3, encryption at rest using AES-256, key management on EU-based infrastructure, pseudonymisation of sensitive data where relevant, data minimization, configurable retention, strict tenant isolation, role-based access control, and audit logging. our company's also have a Data Protection Officer appointed and maintain a data processing register, with a Data Processing Agreement available that aligns with GDPR Article 28. our company's product, Atelier, supports explainability, human oversight, source traceability, and medical confidentiality, ensuring that Our product, Atelier, does not introduce ruptures in clinical or administrative workflows while guaranteeing the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, data sovereignty, and the protection of personal and health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must not require medical device qualification (CE marking, MDR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, data sovereignty, and the protection of personal and health data?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, how do we standard contractual clauses address data protection and privacy?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, as a Société par actions simplifiée registered in France, is subject to various regulatory requirements. we monitor obligations such as GDPR, including Art. 9 special-category data and Art. 28 processing agreements, medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a health context through we Security & Compliance function." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, data sovereignty, and the protection of personal and health data, we are generally compliant due to we ongoing monitoring of regulatory requirements, including GDPR, data sovereignty, and the protection of personal and health data, particularly in the context of health deployments. our standard contractual clauses address data protection and privacy by ensuring that client data ownership is respected, as clients retain full ownership of clients own documents, ingested corpus, and produced data. we also provide for the return and deletion of client data at the end of the contract through we reversibility plan." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, legal risks to flag include the potential for use cases to approach the medical-device threshold, which could imply CE/MDR implications and consequences for liability and positioning. we Legal function is responsible for identifying such risks and flagging such risks accordingly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, as we utilize a proprietary software platform licensed under a subscription/usage model, and with components under permissive licences, there are no known compliance issues related to intellectual property that would hinder we ability to meet the tender's requirements regarding data sovereignty and protection of personal and health data. we professional liability insurance coverage of up to 10 million euros per claim, along with general civil liability cover, provides a basis for managing potential risks associated with data protection and privacy breaches." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Certificates of insurance are available upon request, which can be provided as part of we tender response to demonstrate we compliance and risk management capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is estimated at 900,000 euros over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose to ensure compatibility with The client's budgetary constraints? our target gross margin percentage range is between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To project our projected margin on this contract, our would need to calculate the total costs and then apply our pricing model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that The client's global budget is estimated at 900,000 euros over 5 years, which aligns with our reference budget, our can work within this envelope to ensure compatibility." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One cost-optimization strategy could involve selecting more cost-efficient hosting tiers and models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As noted, the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model are more cost-efficient on the recurring side compared to the premium high-availability tier combined with top-tier proprietary inference." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By favoring the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model where requirements allow, our can protect our gross margin while keeping annual operating costs controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity. our commercial posture is designed to maintain a five-year cost model that can be adjusted if requirements or budgets change, allowing our to dynamically manage costs and ensure the proposed configuration stays within the client's budget envelope while preserving an acceptable margin for Faber IA." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client seeks an intelligent assistance tool that can assist in drafting clinical and administrative content, provide explanations for recommendations or suggestions, and support handling dossiers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy can we design to meet these requirements, considering we LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, and performance benchmarks?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements, we can leverage we Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities, which enable the generation of answers grounded in the organisation's own validated documents. we hybrid retrieval approach, combining lexical and semantic search, will allow for efficient information surfacing to support drafting clinical and administrative content. we can design an iterative methodology that starts with corpus selection and curation with The client experts, followed by retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This approach will enable we to tailor our LLM stack to The client specific needs and ensure high-quality output." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explainability, we can provide source citations, retrieved passages, and a retrieval trace for every interaction, allowing for transparent and auditable decision-making. we human oversight workflow ensures that professionals validate all proposals made by the assistant, aligning with HAS guidance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further enhance performance, we can offer optional fine-tuning on client material, with clear data use terms defined in collaboration with the client and we compliance function. offer will enable we to adapt we model to the client's specific context while maintaining data privacy and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By embedding we AI assistant into the staff's existing work environment and tools, we can ensure seamless workflow integration, avoiding disruption to clinical or administrative practices. we efficiency outcomes have demonstrated reductions in processing and documentation times in comparable deployments, and we expect similar benefits for the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, we AI components and innovation strategy will focus on delivering a highly performant, explainable, and adaptable solution that supports the client's needs in drafting content, providing recommendations, and handling dossiers, while ensuring transparency, auditability, and data privacy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires the solution to contribute to reducing energy consumption, rely on low-carbon infrastructure, and limit environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What is our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, and experience with green hosting partners that demonstrate our company's commitment to sustainability and ability to meet these environmental requirements? our company's, has an EcoVadis rating of Silver. our company's have conducted a bilan carbone, which means our company's have assessed our company's carbon footprint, and a bilan carbone, which means we have assessed our carbon footprint covers scope 1, scope 2, and main scope 3 items including cloud inference." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's have published a trajectory to reduce our company's carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of green hosting partners, our company's work with OuraneCloud in the EU region, which offers sovereign hosting, renewable energy, and a power usage effectiveness of 1.2, as well as heat reuse. work demonstrates our company's commitment to sustainability and ability to meet environmental requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering proposes an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution tailored to the healthcare sector, specifically designed to support hospital staff in clinical and administrative activities. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution tailored to the healthcare sector, specifically designed to support hospital staff in clinical and administrative activities integrates with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), ensuring seamless continuity of care between professionals and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering intelligent assistance tool provides functionality for retrieving information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulations, as well as assisting in drafting medical and administrative documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our intelligent assistance tool also supports handling dossiers and provides explanations for recommendations or suggestions through source grounding and audit trails. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution tailored to the healthcare sector, specifically designed to support hospital staff in clinical and administrative activities adapts generated content to the clinical-administrative context and conforms to expected quality standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering has developed a pilot project, Medical Documentation Assistant, and has collaborated with regional hospital groups, demonstrating Nexus Engineering ability to deliver tailored AI assistants." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering technical stack is fully covered, and Nexus Engineering have a hybrid delivery model." ;
